{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghca9BsAwjUtoWc3BXSY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The ground state changes from high spin to low spin at **Dq ≈ 1318 cm⁻¹** (Δ_o = 10Dq ≈ 13 176 cm⁻¹, Δ/B ≈ 16.4).\n\n**Method**\n- I set up the full ligand-field model for d⁶ in an octahedral field. This means 6 electrons spread over the 10 d spin-orbitals, which gives 210 Slater determinants.\n- The Hamiltonian has two parts:\n  - The electron–electron repulsion, built from Slater integrals converted from your parameters: F₂ = 49B + 7C and F₄ = 441C/35. With B = 803 cm⁻¹ and C = 3 078 cm⁻¹, C/B ≈ 3.83.\n  - The octahedral crystal field, which depends linearly on Dq.\n- I diagonalised the full matrix, so configuration mixing is included. For example, the ¹A₁g state mixes with t₂g⁴e_g², t₂g²e_g⁴ and similar configurations; it is not treated as pure t₂g⁶.\n- I used the total spin operator to pick out the lowest quintet (high spin, ⁵T₂g) and the lowest singlet (low spin, ¹A₁g).\n- I then found the Dq at which these two states have the same energy.\n\n**Checks**\n- With Dq = 0, the lowest state is ⁵D, as it should be for a free d⁶ ion.\n- The quintet-minus-singlet energy gap changes sign once, between Dq = 1000 and 1500 cm⁻¹, and keeps increasing as Dq increases:\n\n| Dq (cm⁻¹) | E(⁵T₂g) − E(¹A₁g) (cm⁻¹) |\n|---|---|\n| 1500 | +3 517 |\n| 2000 | +13 231 |\n| 2500 | +23 014 |\n| 3000 | +32 844 |\n\n- The crossover found by root-finding is Dq = 1317.6 cm⁻¹.\n- The crossover comes out below the usual Tanabe–Sugano value of about Δ/B ≈ 20 because that diagram uses C/B = 4.8. Your smaller C/B lowers the spin-pairing energy, so low spin takes over at a weaker field.\n\n{\"Dq\": 1318, \"B\": 803, \"C\": 3078, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Full d6 octahedral ligand-field diagonalization gives 5T2g/1A1g crossover at Dq ≈ 1318 cm^-1.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1600,"cache_read_input_tokens":4443,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1600,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bffb01e4-64aa-40aa-8558-23215ee5256f","uuid":"d7c8985d-aa4e-467f-b081-2d5ff0cb6195","timestamp":"2026-11-04T09:00:18.907Z","request_id":"req_011Cghca8ka9RkA8oRspDCAN"}
